{"text": "Alice was sitting by her sister on a river bank, and she was very bored. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Once or twice she looked into the book that her sister was reading. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But it had no pictures or conversations in it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And what is the use of a book, thought Alice, without pictures or conversations. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The hot day made her feel sleepy and a little stupid. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She was wondering whether she should get up and make a daisy chain. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Suddenly a White Rabbit with pink eyes ran close by her. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Rabbit said to itself, Oh dear, Oh dear, I shall be late. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But then the Rabbit took a watch out of its waistcoat pocket and hurried on. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Alice jumped up, because she had never seen a rabbit with a pocket or a watch. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She ran after it and saw it pop down a large rabbit hole under the hedge. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Alice went down after it without thinking how she would get out.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", "l", "i", "c", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "s", "i", "t", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "b", "y", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "s", "i", "s", "t", "e", "r", " ", "o", "n", " ", "a", " ", "r", "i", "v", "e", "r", " ", "b", "a", "n", "k", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "v", "e", "r", "y", " ", "b", "o", "r", "e", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "O", "n", "c", "e", " ", "o", "r", " ", "t", "w", "i", "c", "e", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "l", "o", "o", "k", "e", "d", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "o", "o", "k", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "s", "i", "s", "t", "e", "r", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "r", "e", "a", "d", "i", "n", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".